[[File:Pyrefiend icon.png|left]]
'''Pyrelords''' are stronger variants of [[pyrefiend]]s that require level 30 [[Slayer]] to kill. They are found within the [[Sisterhood Sanctuary]] and on the north side of the [[Isle of Souls]].
{{Bug|Despite being fire demons, pyrelords do not have the [[fiery]] attribute. It is unknown whether this is intentional.}}

==Safespots==
[[File:Pyrelord (Isle of Souls) safespot.png|thumb|Players can safespot Pyrelords by putting a tree in front of them and the Pyrelord.]]
On the [[Isle of Souls]], there are 10 [[Pyrefiend]]s and 3 Pyrelords on the northern part of the island, close to the fairy ring code {{fairycode|BJP}}. They can be [[safespot]]ted by putting a tree between the player and the pyrelord. Unlike pyrefiends, which are 1x1 size monsters, pyrelords are 2x2. This can result in getting the pyrelord stuck behind trees or other obstacles which the player can attack without being hit.

The closest [[bank]] is accessible in the [[Shayzien Encampment]] by using [[fairy ring]] code {{fairycode|DJR}} to the [[Chasm of Fire]] or by using the [[Soul Wars]] [[Minigame Teleport]].

